      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SAIF (2) turned in a plain run last time when sixth at Q Lakeside over 390m behind Select Airley (22.34) in a Grade 5. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to his name from six starts. Better than last start and worth following up. CURIOUS CAZA (1) showed good pace from out wide and was prominent early but began to paddle and faded out of it when 6th at this track in P5 company. Has a good record here at this journey. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings 11 times from 19 starts. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. KICK IT OFF (3) is better than last start when seventh (20.46) from Box 5 at this track over 366m. Has a strong record from box 3, including two wins. A forward showing wouldn't surprise. MONKEY PANTS (8) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
